      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Teaching and Learning Network conducted ILOs workshop to 10 SONAM-Kenya faculty. The workshop aimed at enabling the participants develop ILOs that lead to students' significant learning or students adopting deep learning approaches. By the end of the session, faculty refined their course learning outcomes in relation to Bloom's Taxonomy, Fink's Significant learning, Moon's Learning Environment and Bigg's Structure of Observed Learning Outcomes-SOLO."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
